ferrosintesis-samples-b1-upright
================================

The embedded WAV samples in this crate are a FIRST-PARTY recording: Arthur's own
Yamaha B1 acoustic upright piano, recorded by the author on a Tascam DR-05
(24-bit / 48 kHz / stereo) on 2026-07-23. There is no third-party source and no
external attribution requirement.

Licensed under the repository's own terms: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE-MIT /
LICENSE-APACHE). Full provenance and the exact processing pipeline are in
PROVENANCE.md.
